{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TNgdaGWot8dWma8ig6Uh1m","type":"tool_result","content":"154\t### sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic — Creature {10} 7/7 — attack recast (uses G1, G5)\n155\t- **Clauses:** \"Costs {1} less per instant/sorcery card in your graveyard. Reach. Whenever it\n156\t  attacks, you may cast target instant/sorcery from your graveyard without paying its mana cost.\n157\t  If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n158\t- **Analogue:** cost reduction `cards/fdn/fdn_57`/`fdn_6`; attack trigger `cards/fdn/fdn_245`;\n159\t  graveyard redirect `cards/fdn/fdn_244`.\n160\t- **Seams:** **G1** (fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent`), **G5** (`cast_spell_free` from graveyard +\n161\t  one-shot exile-instead-of-graveyard replacement).\n162\t- **Impl:** base `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.REACH`, base P/T 7/7. `cost_reduction(game)` =\n163\t  count of cards in controller's graveyard whose `card_types` include INSTANT or SORCERY (engine\n164\t  clamps to the {10} generic). `register_triggers`: `AttacksTriggeredEvent`, condition\n165\t  `event.creature is self`, effect = `choose_yes_no` then pick a target instant/sorcery in your\n166\t  graveyard, register a one-shot `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent` on that card (redirect to exile),\n167\t  then `cast_spell_free(game, controller, spell, Zone.GRAVEYARD)`.\n168\t- **Edge/tests:** cost is {10} minus graveyard count, floored at 0 colored pips (none here);\n169\t  attacking with empty graveyard / declining → nothing cast; the recast spell, after resolving,\n170\t  goes to **exile** not graveyard (assert zone). Use `declare_attackers` helper to fire G1.\n171\t\n172\t### sos_245 — Witherbloom, the Balancer — Creature {6}{B}{G} 5/5 — Affinity (uses G6)\n173\t- **Clauses:** \"Affinity for creatures (costs {1} less per creature you control). Flying,"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1404691a-99e3-4d00-a347-c654df745e5c","uuid":"f3996327-ba7a-40a4-9683-da7bada