st card you drew this turn.)\\n\"\n            \"At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a \"\n            \"card. If you do, draw a card.\",\n        )\n        super().__init__(**kwargs)\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2573,"cache_read_input_tokens":116104,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2573},"output_tokens":64,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1404691a-99e3-4d00-a347-c654df745e5c","uuid":"de58a1d8-03a3-44b7-a161-47703e3276b9","request_id":"req_011CbhW1MdVjdjtxdUPTHsCu"}
