{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Njwu6N6Hq38ahfjPypNArU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YRns4EJkc2bghDKdczKDjB","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/PLAN.md","old_string":"- **Edge/tests:** miracle offered only on the **first** draw of the turn (verify the per-turn\n  reset), only for instant/sorcery, only while Lorehold is on the battlefield; declining leaves the\n  card in hand. The opponent-upkeep loot is a \"may\", and only on opponents' upkeeps. Expert.\n","new_string":"- **Edge/tests:** miracle offered only on the **first** draw of the turn (verify the per-turn\n  reset), only for instant/sorcery, only while Lorehold is on the battlefield; declining leaves the\n  card in hand. The opponent-upkeep loot is a \"may\", and only on opponents' upkeeps. Expert.\n- **DEVIATION (built):** G10 done as two additive engine pieces: (1) `cast_for_cost(game, player,\n  card, cost, from_zone=HAND)` in `engine/casting.py` — mirrors `cast_spell` but pays a supplied\n  ManaCost and skips the timing check (window granted by the miracle trigger); fires\n  SpellCastTriggeredEvent. (2) per-turn reset of `cards_drawn_this_turn` for all players added to\n  `_do_untap_step` in `engine/turn.py` (the increment + DrawsCardTriggeredEvent fire already existed\n  in `game.draw_card`). Both inert for the 1145 engine tests. Trigger effects read event data via\n  the codebase's capture-on-condition pattern (cf. fdn_111). Tested by calling real `draw_card` /\n  firing `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` then resolving the stack.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":683,"cache_read_input_tokens":134440,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":683},"output_tokens":50,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":nul