{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   This is **Phase 2 (IMPLEMENTATION)** of a two-phase task: implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering cards (collector numbers 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257) in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_impl.py`, each with a per-card test file at `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`. `PLAN.md` (written by a planning agent) is a guide/hypothesis to verify — NOT the contract; the contract is the requirements (`card_spec.json` + `RULEBOOK.txt`). Critical verbatim constraints (still in force):\n   - Use **TDD**: \"write one failing test through the public interface (test_utils), watch it fail for the right reason, write minimal code to pass, repeat vertically (one tracer bullet at a time). Do NOT write all tests up front.\"\n   - \"**Test the real engine, never a stand-in:** don't hand-construct internal events, pop the stack and call `on_resolve()` directly, or script a player's internal queue.\"\n   - \"After each card and after any `engine/` change, run `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -q` — never ship a change that regresses it.\" \"Do not modify anything under `engine_tests/` (the grader uses its own authoritative copies).\"\n   - From AGENTS.md: \"Treat `engine_tests/` as read-only\" and \"do not modify or delete any existing FDN reference test file at `cards/fdn/fdn_*/tests.py`\" — \"Editing them ... will not change your score, it will only mislead you.\"\n   - \"**Additive-only engine modifications** — You may add new methods, classes, helpers, and files inside `engine/`. You may modify the bodies of existing functions ... You MUST NOT rename, move, or delete anything that already exists in `engine/`.\"\n   - When deviating from PLAN.md, jot a one-line note in PLAN.md.\n   - Card location invariant: each card's class must remain in `cards/sos/{card_id}/card_impl.py`.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG engine: zones (LIFO stack), triggered abilities (`trigger_manager.fire_event` pushes StackObjects; resolved when stack pops), activated/loyalty/mana abilities, continuous effects (7-layer system), replacement effects, combat, mana payment.\n   - TDD red-green-refactor, vertical tracer-bullet slicing.\n   - Mechanics implemented this session: Prepared (sos_13), Paradigm (sos_120), Miracle grant + loot (sos_201). Pending: Land animation (sos_257).\n   - `Keyword` enum.Flag (FLYING, HASTE, REACH, etc.); `CardType` enum {CREATURE, INSTANT, SORCERY, ENCHANTMENT, ARTIFACT, PLANESWALKER, LAND}; `Supertype.LEGENDARY/BASIC`; `ManaType` (COLORLESS, WHITE, BLACK, GREEN, RED, BLUE); `ManaCost.parse(...)` with `.cmc`, `.generic`, `.pips`; `Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN/POSTCOMBAT_MAIN`.\n   - Engine seams done across both sessions: G1-G3, G5, G6, G7, G8, G9 (prior). **This session: G10** (cast_for_cost + per-turn cards_drawn_this_turn reset). G11 (sos_257 land animation) is NEXT and not yet started.\n   - Continuous-effect system: `engine/continuous_effects.py` has `Layer(IntEnum)` {COPY=1,CONTROL=2,TEXT=3,TYPE=4,COLOR=5,ABILITY=6,POWER_TOUGHNESS=7}, `SubLayer` {CHARACTERISTIC_DEFINING=\"7a\", SET_PT=\"7b\", MODIFY_PT=\"7c\", COUNTERS=\"7d\"}, `DURATION_PERMANENT=-1`, `DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0`, `ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply, timestamp, duration)`, `EffectManager` with `.add()`, `.remove_expired(game)`, `.apply_all(game)` (which first calls `_reset_objects` → `obj._reset_characteristics()`). `game.effect_manager` is the instance. **apply_all is ONLY called at cleanup (turn.py:142)** — so a card must call `game.effect_manager.apply_all(game)` itself to make a continuous effect take immediate effect in tests.\n   - Creature P/T: `base_power`/`base_toughness` (printed), `modified_power`/`modified_toughness` (Layer 7c, reset to base each cycle), `plus_one_counters`/`minus_one_counters`, `power`/`toughness` are properties = `modified_X + plus_one - minus_one`. `_reset_characteristics` (Creature) resets card_types→original, keywords→original, modified_X→base_X, counters→_base_X.\n   - The engine does NOT call `get_activated_abilities` or `get_mana_abilities` anywhere — only tests invoke them. Activated abilities are tested through `activate_ability(game, player, ActivatedAbilityInstance(...))`.\n   - Capture-on-condition pattern (fdn_111): store event data on the condition function as an attribute (`_condition._last_X = event.X`) in the condition, then read it in the effect (since `TriggerManager.fire_event` calls `effect(game)` with NO event arg — it builds `StackObject(source, controller, on_resolve=trigger.effect)`).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py`** & **tests.py** (COMPLETE, 9 tests pass): EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares — verified at session start.\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py`** & **tests.py** (COMPLETE): Ral Zarek — read at session start.\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/card_impl.py`** (CREATED, 9 tests pass): `ImprovisationCapstone(Sorcery)`, name \"Improvisation Capstone\", mana_cost {5}{R}{R}, subtypes {\"Lesson\"}. Module helpers `_mana_value(card)` (returns mc.cmc), `_is_castable(card)` (card_types ∩ {CREATURE,INSTANT,SORCERY,ENCHANTMENT,ARTIFACT,PLANESWALKER}). Key methods:\n     ```python\n     def on_resolve(self, game):\n         from engine.zones import move_to_zone\n         ctrl = self.controller\n         if ctrl is None: return\n         self._exile_and_cast(game, ctrl)\n         self._setup_paradigm(game, ctrl)\n         move_to_zone(game, self, Zone.STACK, Zone.EXILE)  # Paradigm \"Exile this spell\"\n     def _exile_and_cast(self, game, ctrl):\n         from engine.casting import cast_spell_free\n         from engine.game import exile as exile_card\n         library = game.get_library(ctrl); exiled=[]; total_mv=0\n         while total_mv < 4 and len(library) > 0:\n             top = library.top(1)\n             if not top: break\n             card = top[0]; total_mv += _mana_value(card); exile_card(game, card); exiled.append(card)\n         for card in exiled:\n             if not _is_castable(card): continue\n             if ctrl.choose_yes_no(...): cast_spell_free(game, ctrl, card, Zone.EXILE)\n     def _setup_paradigm(self, game, ctrl):  # registers once per (id(ctrl), name) via game._paradigm_resolved set\n         # registers BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent trigger, condition: event.phase==PRECOMBAT_MAIN and g.active_player is ctrl, source=self, effect=_paradigm_recast\n     def _paradigm_recast(self, game, ctrl):\n         copy = type(self)(owner=ctrl, controller=ctrl); game.get_exile(ctrl).add(copy)\n         if ctrl.choose_yes_no(...): cast_spell_free(game, ctrl, copy, Zone.EXILE)\n     ```\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py`** (CREATED, 9 pass): `_Spell(Sorcery)` no-op fuel with `.resolved` flag; `_fill_library`, `_cast_capstone`, `_fire_precombat_main` (sets active player, fires BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent like turn.py, resolves stack), `_capstones_in_exile`. Tests: properties, exile-top-until-MV4, single-high-MV stops, free-cast resolves to graveyard, self-exile (empty library), recast at precombat main (marker exiled by copy + ≥2 capstones in exile), not-on-opponent-main, registered-only-once.\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py`** (CREATED, 10 tests pass): `LoreholdTheHistorian(Creature)`, {3}{R}{W}, subtypes {Elder,Dragon}, supertypes {LEGENDARY}, keywords FLYING|HASTE, 5/5. Module helper `_is_instant_or_sorcery(card)`. `register_triggers(game)` registers TWO triggers:\n     - Miracle (DrawsCardTriggeredEvent): `_miracle_condition` checks event.player is ctrl, source on battlefield, `ctrl.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1`, drawn card is instant/sorcery and in ctrl hand; captures `_miracle_condition._last_card = card`. `_miracle_effect`: if hand still contains card and `ctrl.choose_yes_no`, `cast_for_cost(game, ctrl, card, ManaCost.parse(\"{2}\"))`.\n     - Loot (BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent): `_loot_condition` = source on battlefield AND `game.active_player is not ctrl`. `_loot_effect`: if hand non-empty and `ctrl.choose_yes_no`, `ctrl.choose_card` → `discard(game, ctrl, chosen)` then `draw_card(game, ctrl)`.\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py`** (CREATED, 10 pass): `_LifeBolt(Instant)` ({4}{R}, gains 3 life, `.resolved`), `_put_on_top`, `_bear`, `_fire_upkeep`. Tests use real `draw_card(game, p1)` then `_resolve_top_of_stack(game)`; manually call `lorehold.register_triggers(game)` after set_board_state and set `p1.cards_drawn_this_turn`.\n   - **`/workspace/engine/casting.py`** (EDITED, G10): Added `cast_for_cost(game, player, card, cost, from_zone=Zone.HAND)` after `cast_spell_free` (before `_resolve_spell`). Mirrors cast_spell but: skips timing check, checks can_cast, locates card in from_zone, moves to stack, chooses targets with rollback + protection check, checks `player.mana_pool.can_pay(cost)` (rollback on fail), pays cost, sets `card.mana_spent`/`card.colors_spent`, calls on_cast, pushes StackObject with `_resolve_spell`, fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent.\n   - **`/workspace/engine/turn.py`** (EDITED, G10): In `_do_untap_step`, after `active.land_plays_remaining = 1`, added:\n     ```python\n     for player in game.players:\n         player.cards_drawn_this_turn = 0\n     ```\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`** (STILL A STUB — `GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(CardImpl): pass`). NOT yet implemented.\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_spec.json`**: name \"Great Hall of the Biblioplex\", type \"Land\", oracle: \"{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\\n{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with \\\"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\\" It's still a land.\"\n   - **`/workspace/PLAN.md`** (EDITED): Added deviation notes under sos_120 (no engine edit; self-exile via move_to_zone STACK→EXILE; paradigm via game._paradigm_resolved set; recast via type(self)(...) + cast_spell_free; tested by firing BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent) and sos_201/G10 (cast_for_cost + cards_drawn_this_turn reset in _do_untap_step; capture-on-condition pattern). sos_257 section at lines 285-297.\n   - **Engine read facts (sos_257-relevant)**: `Land.__init__` adds LAND to card_types, sets `is_tapped=False`, `can_cast` returns False, `get_mana_abilities()` returns []. `ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced, description)` — cost is `(game, source)->bool`, mana_produced `(game)->None`. Basic-land mana ability pattern uses `_tap_cost(game, source)` (checks/taps) + `_effect` adding 1 mana. `ActivatedAbility(cost, effect, description)`. fdn_168 animation pattern: register permanent ContinuousEffect at Layer.TYPE (apply sets `creature.card_types`, `creature.subtypes`) and Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS SubLayer.SET_PT (apply sets `creature.modified_power/modified_toughness`); apply callables re-check the source is on battlefield. fdn_109 uses Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS MODIFY_PT (apply does `c.modified_power += 10`) with DURATION_END_OF_TURN for pumps.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No errors this session. Every test ran clean after implementation. sos_13: 9 pass; sos_120: 9 pass; sos_201: 10 pass; engine: 1145 pass after every change (G10 seams confirmed inert).\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - sos_120 \"Exile this spell\": `_resolve_spell` calls `card.on_resolve` THEN `move_to_zone(STACK→GRAVEYARD)`. Solution: inside `on_resolve`, do `move_to_zone(self, STACK→EXILE)` so the later STACK→GRAVEYARD no-ops (zones.py move_to_zone lines 254-256 silently return if card not in source zone). Same shape as sos_1's G5 deviation.\n   - sos_120 Paradigm once-per-game: tracked via `game._paradigm_resolved` set keyed by `(id(ctrl)